# Simply Cyber — Cloudflare headers
# Cloudflare _headers spec: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/

# ── Clock In overlay ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Always serve the current version. OBS and the edge will both happily
# hold a stale copy otherwise, so a push would not reach the stream.
/clockin/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
